Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen, welcome to Kazakhstan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's such a pleasure to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:15.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me first start by thanking yourself and the NVIDIA team for the partnership that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:24.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,It spans from the first supercomputers, educational programs, and of course the hackathon which was set a Guinness World Record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the local telecom operators are building their infrastructure with the uh uh powered by NVIDIA technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course our flagship project and AI uh data center Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:44.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is designed around tens of thousands uh advanced NVIDIA chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Kazakhstan uh is building one of the largest in the world uh AI gigafactory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, in the in in Berlin, you challenged Europe how to build the AI economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh today I would we would like to explore uh what with this development of AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,what the future looks like for Kazakhstan, for the people of Kazakhstan, and for the uh talents and economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:15.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's start the um you were talking about the five-layer cake,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:20.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Kazakhstan is also approaching the development of AI throughout the five-layer cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The foundation and the most important one is the energy, and Kazakhstan is investing into the energy infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are planning to almost double our installed energy capacity by 2035 and make it at above 40 uh gigawatts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, energy is intelligence doesn't mean that the countries that have limited access to energy, they will have a limited access to intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's start with that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all, I'm so happy to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the great welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh I I to congratulate uh your president in Kazakhstan for declaring that Kazakhstan will be an AI nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's incredibly visionary and it has uh Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should be commended for your foresight and recognizing that this is a a global technology reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what an incredible opportunity it is for Kazakhstan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I want to congratulate you Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:36.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh for your leadership in helping guide Kazakhstan's AI journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh in just a very short time, frankly, uh you've made incredible incredible progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh while the rest of the world is deciding how to engage and how to build the AI economy, uh here in Kazakhstan, you're doing it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:03:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I think Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I At the core, uh AI is a new technology that is reshaping every industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because this is a general purpose technology and because of its transformative capabilities for every single industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:31.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,for every single citizen, for every company, for every country, uh this is a technology driven industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This industrial revolution is going to affect uh every single every single person, every country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:43.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh however, it is also going to be a new industry in itself, not just a technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a new industry in itself because AI is manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has to be generated in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It cannot be pre-computed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:04:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because it's generated in real time for every single use, it needs to have a new type of factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia creates the computing systems that power AI factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's these AI factories requires natural resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the natural resources it needs is electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:27.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it needs offtake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The offtake is coming from the inspiration of the leadership in Kazakhstan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're inspiring all of your young people, students, university scientists of the industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're inspiring them to engage the AI industry, to engage the AI economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's where the offtake's going to come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:56.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kazakhstan has a fundamental advantage because you have so much natural resource already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have so much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And instead of just exporting energy, in the future, you could transform the energy into intelligence and export intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in order to do all that, you also need to transform your own data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one of the important observations and I'm very happy to see that there is Kazakh LLM.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That you are already transforming, harnessing, processing your own data into your own intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:45.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's important to realize that your country's data embodies, encodes your country's culture,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,history, your humanity, your values are captured in the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that data belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as your natural resources belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The data of your society is also part of your natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, you're able to combine the natural resources of energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the natural resource of the Kazakhstan data of your people in combination with a computation system from Nvidia,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should be able to produce the intelligence necessary to drive all of the AI economy here in Kazakhstan, which is your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:38.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your vision is to create the next economy, the digital economy, the AI economy for Kazakhstan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:46.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the five-layer cake is an excellent framework, and you have all of the assets, all of the natural resources to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:46.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we use the five-layer cake is as the main pillar of our digital Kazakhstan strategy for the next uh uh 5 to 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:07:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when to cuz currently uh the uh total addressable market of AI exceeds 50 trillion US dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:08.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you know at which layer there will be the highest value captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, therefore, maybe we're in the beginning of the process, we have to move in a systemic way with the all five layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen, you mentioned about Kaz LLM, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's speak about a bit uh sovereignty AI, sovereign AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh people are questioning whether we need to have our own Kazakh GPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we want that AI understands and speaks uh Kazakh and uh cultural contexts uh and um cultural specifics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we built several models, uh Kazakh large language models based on open-source open-weight foundation models.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:57.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, at what point it makes sense or it's worthwhile to build the uh our own foundation model from the scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,or does it really make sense at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think it makes complete sense, and in fact, I believe it to be a national security concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intelligence is foundational.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intelligence is general purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:22.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intelligence affects every single citizen, every single company, every single country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,A country's intelligence is produced from its data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:33.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as we mentioned earlier, your country's data is your natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:43.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,You cannot export something as fundamental as your people's culture and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:49.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,values and export that to import the intelligence from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is So, you want to control your own data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:58.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to control your natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:05.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,You also want to control the delivery of the service to your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as you have Kazak Telecom, you have your own electric grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:23.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, you will have your own electric grid, your own internet, your own telecommunications, and your own intelligence grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:35.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense for the intelligence grid, which comes from which powers every part of your country, to be delivered from another country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:42.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is okay to have another country and company supplement, but it cannot be completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:53.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, you have to have some ability to deliver the basic infrastructure services for your own country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:10:00.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The creation of a Kazak ALEM Kazakh Alem is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:06.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,sensible because the invention of the technology is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:12.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the application, the adaptation of the technology is not so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:14.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's, of course, not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:23.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, Kazakhstan has a wealth of science and technology and mathematicians and you have so many programmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:25.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,The developers here are rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:27.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're rich with expertise here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you should be able to take open-source technology, open mono technology, apply it to your language,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:43.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,apply it to your culture, so that you can run and operate the infrastructure of intelligence yourself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:52.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we also believe that open-source allows us to be sovereign and use it on premise with the sensitive data.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:56.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have our own, we built our own tokenizer, collected tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know how to train, to fine-tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this talent development and human capital development is quite important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I saw so many today already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:08.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've seen, by the way, you've So many startups are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:09.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:12.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've seen some of them are in the physical AI space.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's talk a little bit about this physical AI, as you call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's It's a next wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:28.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,People get used to feel AI through the screens, on the screens, on their laptops, computers, smartphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:31.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now, with the next wave,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's moving into the physical AI and where the robots and other hardware systems will interact with each other and work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Kazakhstan is a rich on heavy industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:54.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have factories, mines, transport agriculture agriculture, transport and logistics infrastructure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,and of course, the talented people with the deep expertise in those industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, how what should Kazakhstan do in order to become a hub or a hub for training the robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.15,0:12:12.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen some initial work already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, our specialists know how to train the robots, how to train the models, and work with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:27.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think the Kazakhstan to become a hub and maybe the one of the main partners for Nvidia to train the models for a physical AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:32.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a fantastic idea, and I think it's also an imperative for you to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:35.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want Kazakhstan to be an AI nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:43.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI starts with cognitive AI, cognitive intelligence, soft intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:49.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,but AI includes everything all the way to physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:58.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI is the largest industry of all, of course, because most of the world includes interaction and understanding of the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:13:02.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,You also have very important application here yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mining and natural resources and agriculture, all of the your own indigenous industries today will benefit from the next phase with physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, physical AI is not just robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:20.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robotics is going to be very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The physical AI includes everything from seismic understanding to mapping mines
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and wells to understanding geography 100 and geology where to mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:43.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,how best to mine, uh understanding material science, the processing of chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:46.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that is going to be part of physical AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and AI will be able to tremendously transform each one of those fields from the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,mining of the processing of the minerals to the transformation of the minerals into new materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:03.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,In every single stage of that will benefit from physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:10.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, we're at the beginning of the physical AI journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the next wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:14.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, everybody is in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a great opportunity for you to participate to help shape this future industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:28.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, just as we will have artificial general intelligence for cognitive cognitive intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:33.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,cognitive AI, we will have artificial general robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:35.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I saw some today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cozmo was an example of at the beginnings of artificial general robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:47.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I have great great hopes and ambition that this will be a very large industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.27,0:14:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're delighted to partner with the robotics company here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.54,0:14:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was so happy to see and video is already working with all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it's great to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:59.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we'll try to produce artificial general engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:00.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:09.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Artificial general farmers, artificial general miners, artificial general scientists, every single field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:11.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the main question that concerns people they've been sitting around
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,us is uh their jobs and how AI will convert their working lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:34.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So everyone is curious about whether AI will help make their jobs better or will lead for them to left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what do you think uh what should people care about and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:47.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh use their energy for developing them in five maybe next five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:16:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,is do you have ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:09.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have ambition, then AI and robotics will lift you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:13.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will empower you to do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:20.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you were a farmer and you have ambition, the robots will help you farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:25.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,But because you have ambition, you can expand your operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:28.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can expand your horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:31.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can expand your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you are a scientist and you have ambition, then your AI assistant will expand the universe that you can explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:51.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you are an engineer and you have ambition, then your AI engineer will allow you to explore better designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:55.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the question is simply, do you have ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:59.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have ambition and I believe you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the first country that I've been to where
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:14.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,the president declared the country to be an AI nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:17.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case, AI will lift your nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:19.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will lift your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:25.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will expand your company so that you can compete and expand globally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:28.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will transform your society.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:32.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's how I would think about AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ambition and the uh talent and creativity should be uh taking through the since the childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you've seen all these kids today, the Tumo program that spans from 12 to 18 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:54.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen the Tomorrow school in partnership with the Ecole 42, the peer-to-peer education, which is the 18 plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.81,0:17:58.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we embed Those are all people with ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:17:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Children with ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:00.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:01.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:08.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we uh embed AI into education, into schools, universities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the concern that uh people expressing right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:19.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,how do we make sure that AI helps children to become better thinkers rather than
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:26.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,just relying purely on the eye and uh um to make it harmful for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:32.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, the question is whether that child has ambition and aspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:37.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the child wants to learn more, AI will help them learn more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:44.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the If the child wants to do less, then the AI, of course, can help them do less.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:51.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, it is our job as parents to imbue our children,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:59.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,instill our children with hope, ambition, aspiration to help them dream bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when you dream big, then AI will lift you to achieve that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same exact idea for children as well as for adults, for companies as well as countries and nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:18.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have aspiration, if you have ambition,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:30.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,then it requires the leadership to instill ambition just as President Tokayev instilled ambition for the nation to be an AI nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:31.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:34.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this as all the companies that I've met so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have ambition to be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:38.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have ambition to be global.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:41.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have ambition to be international.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:45.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,That ambition will be powered by AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the most important thing we need to do as country leaders like yourself, as CEOs like myself and my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:20:02.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,as parents, is to instill upon our people, our families, our companies, our nation, instill upon them ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:05.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a real example of ambition then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:12.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have um we talk about this youth, ambition, and the real case of ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:18.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let me turn to uh our AI unicorn, the Hixle AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:27.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh I think this is the greatest example of ambition of young people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's uh our first AI unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:32.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,The average age of the team is 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:38.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And by the way, we have a main co-founders here with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:44.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh we have uh Alex Mashrabov and uh Yersultan Bolat along with their broader team here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:46.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, please stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:50.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The company is valued at a multi-billion uh valuation right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:21:03.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh I have a good update, good news for the people around us and those watching online.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia has invested into Hexel AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:16.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just just a few words about uh Hexel AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:25.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what did really make um Nvidia to decide, you know, to you know, to invest into Hexel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:25.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:30.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,just uh for the other followers to be what should be a northern star
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,for them in order to be in compliant compliant to the investment decisions as yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:40.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the first thing is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:48.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first thing and the last thing is you invest in people, not companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the founders of Hexel are visionary in the work that they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,They had a wonderful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:22:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,It did require and they have global competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have global competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:06.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of them are in San Francisco, United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:09.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredibly well funded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.46,0:22:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a formidable expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.71,0:22:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, these are some of the brightest people in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have an 600 people here in Kazakhstan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have a average age of 25 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of them are deep tech engineers and deep tech computer scientists already with offices here in Kazakhstan and in United States,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're able to bridge the culture and the expertise from two different nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.67,0:22:41.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're competing globally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.07,0:22:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you know when you're investing in a company you're really investing in people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you have to select the best people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.03,0:22:53.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been to their offices once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,They start their work at 5:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:22:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're sitting they're looking for a new office.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:00.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're expanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:02.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,They used to be like 150 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:07.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You start at 5:00 p.m.?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.51,0:23:11.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want my money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.63,0:23:13.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they work overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.11,0:23:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I start at 5:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.83,0:23:24.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today I start at 4:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.39,0:23:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So they're expanding right now looking for an office like 20,000 square meter office and it's a great ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So talented engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:37.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, Kazakhstan has a lot of real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:44.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,It also has a lot of energy and the DC Valley has 1 gigabyte planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.39,0:23:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you're going to have a lot of compute right here in Kazakhstan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it's it's going to be a hub a computing hub and AI factory hub for all of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.51,0:24:01.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The telecommunications interconnection that you created completely visionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.39,0:24:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now it put Kazakhstan right in the middle of the European AI ecosystem and then you could feel the AI economy throughout.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.83,0:24:11.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.95,0:24:20.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk a little bit Let's talk a little bit about the security issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.47,0:24:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we see I mean what my recent news on some security hacks, jailbreaks and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.43,0:24:35.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't Nvidia plan to uh develop a technology uh that's embedded into the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.59,0:24:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,hardware whenever their models got hacked or uh something happening wrong with the models?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.41,0:24:52.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will there be a technology on the hardware uh on the hardware of Nvidia that helps to mitigate those risks?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:25:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, in order for us to enjoy for the world to enjoy the positive benefits and the incredible opportunities that will be created by AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:08.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have to develop it and advance it and deploy it responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.55,0:25:15.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as when we're building self-driving cars, safety is vital from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.19,0:25:23.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as when you're uh mining and you want to have a mining industry, safety is vital from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.11,0:25:31.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so if we we want if we want society to benefit from AI, it is important and it's the responsibility of the creators,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.14,0:25:40.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,the creators like Nvidia, creators like uh Higgsfield, that we advance this technology in a responsible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.23,0:25:48.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology to keep AI safe is foundational technology as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.35,0:25:52.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology has to be invented, the technology has to be engineered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:55.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,We created a technology called OpenShell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:26:00.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,OpenShell contains this autonomous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.67,0:26:07.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,These agents are essentially self-driving cars or robots inside a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.55,0:26:15.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you give them access to files and access to tools, they will freely go about access the files to do their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.47,0:26:23.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we have to contain them to make sure that whatever access is exactly the access we want it to have,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.14,0:26:32.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,whatever privileges are limited to what it needs to it needs in order to do its job, and we need to monitor it at all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.51,0:26:43.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the technology for deploying, for even creating the AI safely, is called Open Shell, and I advise everybody to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.51,0:26:45.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.71,0:26:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The the the definitely uh there are lots of uh new ideas that coming up especially in this fast-changing environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.09,0:27:03.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Has there been any particular uh situation where you change your mind about AI in the past year?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:10.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, I I'm more enthusiastic today about AI than I was a year ago, and I was very enthusiastic a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.59,0:27:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I The the big breakthroughs in AI this last year, especially with agentic systems, we've made AI useful now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:31.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh in fact, if you look at the Higgs Field generated videos, in just 1 year's time, it has improved tremendously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.15,0:27:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the beginning, Higgs Field was able to generate short videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.00,0:27:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, you can generate very long videos that is temporally and physically con- consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.17,0:27:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh it uh tells a story uh for a very long period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.53,0:27:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not possible without agentic reasoning systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.14,0:28:01.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the technology has become very useful in video generation, of course, word generation, and software coding,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.22,0:28:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and robotic systems, and drug discovery, in so many different fields, uh these systems have become very very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.15,0:28:20.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh we we haven't mentioned you, and we didn't have a chance to present you that um a month ago we were running the first AI Film Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.71,0:28:27.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, which um uh it's a contest with more than 8,000 applications,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.91,0:28:36.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,videos submitted of more than 100,000 minutes in total, with the more than 120 countries participated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:40.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the $2 million prize and uh With how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.59,0:28:42.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,$2 million prize pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.43,0:28:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.87,0:28:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh and for the jury, it was very difficult to determine which video is uh better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.75,0:28:57.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's uh Kazakhstan's going to be the home of the Khan Festival of AI films.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.91,0:29:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a decent decentralization of Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.71,0:29:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.13,0:29:06.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.19,0:29:08.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:11.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, for the sake of time, yeah, we have to wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.51,0:29:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh just the final one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.92,0:29:17.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I have a question from the audience here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.39,0:29:26.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh so, if you were 18 years old and living in Kazakhstan today, what would you spend the next 5 years learning and building?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.35,0:29:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I I envy um being 18 years old today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.15,0:29:44.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because the world is changing so rapidly and there's a complete reset uh because of technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.11,0:29:54.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, when I was I was fortunate because when I was 18 years old, the personal computer was just becoming possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.39,0:30:00.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And my generation was I I've been working for 43 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.50,0:30:05.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,My generation was defined by the creation of the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.39,0:30:16.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all of our four decades of endeavors has led to now artificial intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:21.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is a complete reset of everything that we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.43,0:30:27.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead of programming the computer, you have to learn how to program AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.39,0:30:35.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, that young man here in Kazakhstan, you're 18 years old, AI is now new for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.90,0:30:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's new for everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.71,0:30:44.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would dedicate myself to be the world's best programmer of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.63,0:30:48.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, AI is has the ability to automate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.30,0:30:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has the ability to partner with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:53.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has ability to assist us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.87,0:31:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But just as you partner with some human, you and you have assistant from somebody, you have to learn how to interact.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.68,0:31:04.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to learn how to program each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.31,0:31:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do they have to learn a technical skills or just social sciences in order to do better prompting?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.83,0:31:11.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need both.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.31,0:31:18.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to understand the best programmer of AI is someone who understands how AI works.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.15,0:31:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best user of a machine is someone who understands how the machine works.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.87,0:31:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best driver of a race car is someone who understands how the car works.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.88,0:31:39.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the best programmer of AI should understand how the machinery of AI works, what it's what it's fundamental principles are,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.19,0:31:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,what it's strengths are, weaknesses are, how it's developing, where it will be in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:52.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so all of these properties about the technology must be understood if you want to under-
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.95,0:31:56.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you want to harness the capability of AI to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.79,0:32:07.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you have a lot of technical reasons to engage AI, and you have extraordinary potential when you learn how to program AI, how to use AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.51,0:32:12.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And probably you've seen that the children and the youth that we have here at LMAI,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.75,0:32:17.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're probably on the right Well, they were upstairs already using AI, programming AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.83,0:32:18.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.87,0:32:20.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you, Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.35,0:32:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it was such a pleasure to have you here on the fireside chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:28.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's your It's your first visit to Kazakhstan and hope not the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.31,0:32:32.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we look forward to expanding our partnership with Nvidia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.59,0:32:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.13,0:32:35.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give a round of applause to Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:36.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.83,0:32:42.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.51,0:32:45.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have uh Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.31,0:32:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have a small Kazakh tradition to our respected guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.29,0:32:54.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We usually give our present, which is called chapan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.51,0:33:01.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.79,0:33:07.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,For you to feel like a king of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.71,0:33:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.63,0:33:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the Kazakh traditional robe of honor given to our most esteemed guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:18.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.27,0:33:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wear it with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.68,0:33:22.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,It fits you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
